*{{item link|Crystal Heart}}
====[[Plains]]====
*{{item link|Linen Cape}}
*{{item link|Lox Cape}}
====[[Mistlands]]====
*{{item link|Himminafl}}
*{{item link|Wisplight}}
===Building===
*{{item link|Butcher's Table}}
*{{item link|Treasure Chest}}

== Notes ==

* A [[Wishbone]] is generally required to find [[Silver Vein]]s, however they can rarely be found exposed to the surface.
* [[Silver Vein]]s can also be found by slamming patches of ground with [[Stagbreaker]]. If the text "Too Hard" pops up under the slam, and there are no rocks nearby, there is most likely silver underground.
* Like other metals, {{PAGENAME}} cannot be teleported without a [[Portal stone]].
* If dug completely around and underneath (so it's floating), the entire node can be destroyed by destroying one piece.
* It takes 214 Silver to craft one of each base equipment (armor, weapons, tools) in the [[Mountain]] Tier. Further 516 Silver to fully upgrade (total 730 Silver). 222 Silver to craft one of each base equipment in all [[Biomes]] tiers. Further 521 Silver to fully upgrade (total 743 Silver).

